{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras/b18b38939c3ef35a37dfc83fd93fd98d.avif?t=1748491313\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras_big/b18b38939c3ef35a37dfc83fd93fd98d.avif?t=1748491313 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE KIDS LAUGH!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where's that Clown is a frantic top down arcade game where you've got to keep impatient kids entertained throughout chaotic birthday party venues. Throughout hectic, fast-paced rounds, you can bring randomly-spawning comedic props -- whoopie cushions, juggling pins, pies, and more -- to groups of partygoing children who eagerly await a good laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WATCH OUT FOR MOM AND DAD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While bouncing between groups of partygoers, you might run into mom and dad. The angry parents want to make sure they're getting every penny's worth from your services! Bump into them and you'll have to suffer a mean scolding...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USE EXCITING PERKS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras/bc3b0df17551d9afe4b0c18eade612d1.avif?t=1748491313\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras_big/bc3b0df17551d9afe4b0c18eade612d1.avif?t=1748491313 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras/2a7040a637e1bc99a3a678b850cb447d.avif?t=1748491313\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras_big/2a7040a637e1bc99a3a678b850cb447d.avif?t=1748491313 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring some exciting new toys to the party with the<strong>\u00a0TRAMPOLINE</strong>\u00a0and<strong> CLOWN CAR</strong>, which take your party entertaining skills to the next level! Leap over mom and dad to avoid their stern talking-to's, or steamroll through the party to get to impatient crowds quicker.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730960?t=1748491313","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/290ecf84456f9d9371970d42b5656242ab330681/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748491313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/ba68ab56226f8f25d6e0e133437abc4eea57630c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748491313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/ba68ab56226f8f25d6e0e133437abc4eea57630c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748491313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras/b18b38939c3ef35a37dfc83fd93fd98d.avif?t=1748491313\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras_big/b18b38939c3ef35a37dfc83fd93fd98d.avif?t=1748491313 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE KIDS LAUGH!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where's that Clown is a frantic top down arcade game where you've got to keep impatient kids entertained throughout chaotic birthday party venues. Throughout hectic, fast-paced rounds, you can bring randomly-spawning comedic props -- whoopie cushions, juggling pins, pies, and more -- to groups of partygoing children who eagerly await a good laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WATCH OUT FOR MOM AND DAD!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While bouncing between groups of partygoers, you might run into mom and dad. The angry parents want to make sure they're getting every penny's worth from your services! Bump into them and you'll have to suffer a mean scolding...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USE EXCITING PERKS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras/bc3b0df17551d9afe4b0c18eade612d1.avif?t=1748491313\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras_big/bc3b0df17551d9afe4b0c18eade612d1.avif?t=1748491313 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras/2a7040a637e1bc99a3a678b850cb447d.avif?t=1748491313\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/extras_big/2a7040a637e1bc99a3a678b850cb447d.avif?t=1748491313 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring some exciting new toys to the party with the<strong>\u00a0TRAMPOLINE</strong>\u00a0and<strong> CLOWN CAR</strong>, which take your party entertaining skills to the next level! Leap over mom and dad to avoid their stern talking-to's, or steamroll through the party to get to impatient crowds quicker.</p>","developers":["Hivemind Labs LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730960/359d7d91009673637da1d28ff2073269761e4b49/header.jpg?t=1748491313","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended: